    "message": "chore(ci): remove the temporary toolchain probe\n\nThe probe did its job: on ubuntu-latest (rustup 1.29.1, default host\nx86_64-unknown-linux-gnu) it showed the old host-triple pin failing with\n`error: target tuple in channel name '1.98.1-x86_64-pc-windows-gnu'` and the\nversion-only pin resolving to 1.98.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, with every\nmandatory rust-job step green (fmt, workspace tests 107/0/2, both clippy runs,\ne2e tests 16/0). Logs remain on the scratch branch ci-probe-results.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
